---
const GITHUB_REPO = "https://github.com/Richard-zip/Agnes";
const GITHUB_RELEASES = "https://github.com/Richard-zip/Agnes/releases";
const LATEST_RELEASE = "https://github.com/Richard-zip/Agnes/releases/latest";
---

<section id="descargar" class="py-24 relative overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Glow backdrop -->
  <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[900px] h-[350px] bg-indigo-600/10 blur-[140px] rounded-full pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative">
    
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-4 mb-16">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-indigo-500/10 border border-indigo-500/20 text-indigo-400 text-xs font-semibold">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 16v1a3 3 0 003 3h10a3 3 0 003-3v-1m-4-4l-4 4m0 0l-4-4m4 4V4"></path></svg>
        <span>Zona de Descargas Oficiales</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight">
        Obtén Agnes para tu plataforma
      </h2>
      <p class="text-slate-300 text-base">
        Elige tu sistema operativo y descarga el release oficial alojado en GitHub. 100% libre, gratuito y sin malware.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Download Cards Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      
      <!-- Linux Card -->
      <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-7 border border-slate-700/60 flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-indigo-500/50 transition-all duration-300 group shadow-lg">
        <div class="space-y-5">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-indigo-500/10 border border-indigo-500/20 text-indigo-400 flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-indigo-600 group-hover:text-white transition-colors">
              <!-- Linux Tux Icon -->
              <svg class="w-7 h-7 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path d="M12 2C9.5 2 7.5 3.8 7.5 6c0 .8.2 1.5.6 2.1C6.8 9.2 6 10.7 6 12.5c0 1.2.4 2.3 1 3.2-.6 1-.9 2.1-.9 3.3 0 2.2 2.6 3 5.9 3s5.9-.8 5.9-3c0-1.2-.3-2.3-.9-3.3.6-.9 1-2 1-3.2 0-1.8-.8-3.3-2.1-4.4.4-.6.6-1.3.6-2.1 0-2.2-2-4-4.5-4zm-1.8 4c.6 0 1 .4 1 1s-.4 1-1 1-1-.4-1-1 .4-1 1-1zm3.6 0c.6 0 1 .4 1 1s-.4 1-1 1-1-.4-1-1 .4-1 1-1z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider bg-indigo-500/10 text-indigo-400 border border-indigo-500/20">
              Linux
            </span>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-white">AppImage Autónomo</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">Paquete portable universal compatible con Ubuntu, Debian, Arch Linux, Fedora, Manjaro y Linux Mint.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-2 pt-2">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-400 border-b border-slate-800 pb-2">
              <span>Formato:</span>
              <span class="font-mono text-slate-200">.AppImage (x86_64)</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-400">
              <span>Modo:</span>
              <span class="text-slate-200">Sin instalación previa</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-6 space-y-3">
          <a 
            href={GITHUB_RELEASES} 
            target="_blank" 
            rel="noopener noreferrer" 
            class="w-full inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5 py-3.5 px-4 rounded-xl bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-500 text-white font-bold text-xs transition-colors shadow-lg shadow-indigo-600/30"
          >
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 16v1a3 3 0 003 3h10a3 3 0 003-3v-1m-4-4l-4 4m0 0l-4-4m4 4V4"></path></svg>
            <span>Descargar AppImage en GitHub</span>
          </a>

          <div class="bg-slate-950/80 rounded-lg p-2.5 border border-slate-800 text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400 flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="truncate">chmod +x Agnes*.AppImage</span>
            <span class="text-indigo-400 text-[10px]">Paso terminal</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Windows Card -->
      <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-7 border border-slate-700/60 flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-blue-500/50 transition-all duration-300 group shadow-lg">
        <div class="space-y-5">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-500/20 text-blue-400 flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-blue-600 group-hover:text-white transition-colors">
              <!-- Windows Icon -->
              <svg class="w-7 h-7 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path d="M0 3.449L9.75 2.1v9.451H0m10.949-9.602L24 0v11.4H10.949M0 12.6h9.75v9.451L0 20.699M10.949 12.6H24V24l-12.902-1.799"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider bg-blue-500/10 text-blue-400 border border-blue-500/20">
              Windows
            </span>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-white">Instalador & Portable</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">Paquete ejecutable listo para Windows 10 y Windows 11 de 64 bits con soporte headless integrado.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-2 pt-2">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-400 border-b border-slate-800 pb-2">
              <span>Formato:</span>
              <span class="font-mono text-slate-200">.exe (NSIS / Portable)</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-400">
              <span>Compatibilidad:</span>
              <span class="text-slate-200">Windows 10 / 11 (64-bit)</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-6 space-y-3">
          <a 
            href={GITHUB_RELEASES} 
            target="_blank" 
            rel="noopener noreferrer" 
            class="w-full inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5 py-3.5 px-4 rounded-xl bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-500 text-white font-bold text-xs transition-colors shadow-lg shadow-blue-600/30"
          >
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 16v1a3 3 0 003 3h10a3 3 0 003-3v-1m-4-4l-4 4m0 0l-4-4m4 4V4"></path></svg>
            <span>Descargar para Windows en GitHub</span>
          </a>

          <div class="bg-slate-950/80 rounded-lg p-2.5 border border-slate-800 text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400 text-center">
            Doble clic y ejecutar directamente
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Source Code Card -->
      <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-7 border border-slate-700/60 flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-slate-500/50 transition-all duration-300 group shadow-lg">
        <div class="space-y-5">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 text-slate-300 flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-slate-700 group-hover:text-white transition-colors">
              <!-- Git / Code Icon -->
              <svg class="w-7 h-7 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M12 2C6.477 2 2 6.484 2 12.017c0 4.425 2.865 8.18 6.839 9.504.5.092.682-.217.682-.483 0-.237-.008-.868-.013-1.703-2.782.605-3.369-1.343-3.369-1.343-.454-1.158-1.11-1.466-1.11-1.466-.908-.62.069-.608.069-.608 1.003.07 1.53 1.032 1.53 1.032.892 1.53 2.341 1.088 2.91.832.092-.647.35-1.088.636-1.338-2.22-.253-4.555-1.113-4.555-4.951 0-1.093.39-1.988 1.029-2.688-.103-.253-.446-1.272.098-2.65 0 0 .84-.27 2.75 1.026A9.564 9.564 0 0112 6.844c.85.004 1.705.115 2.504.337 1.909-1.296 2.747-1.027 2.747-1.027.546 1.379.202 2.398.1 2.651.64.7 1.028 1.595 1.028 2.688 0 3.848-2.339 4.695-4.566 4.943.359.309.678.92.678 1.855 0 1.338-.012 2.419-.012 2.747 0 .268.18.58.688.482A10.019 10.019 0 0022 12.017C22 6.484 17.522 2 12 2z"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 border border-slate-700">
              Open Source
            </span>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-white">Código Fuente</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">Clona el repositorio, audita el código o compila tu propia versión personalizada con Electron + Vite.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-2 pt-2">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-400 border-b border-slate-800 pb-2">
              <span>Stack:</span>
              <span class="text-slate-200">React 18 + TS + Electron</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-400 border-b border-slate-800 pb-2">
              <span>Licencia:</span>
              <span class="font-mono text-indigo-400 font-semibold">MIT License</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-400">
              <span>Gestor:</span>
              <span class="font-mono text-slate-200">pnpm</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-6 space-y-3">
          <a 
            href={GITHUB_REPO} 
            target="_blank" 
            rel="noopener noreferrer" 
            class="w-full inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5 py-3.5 px-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-white font-bold text-xs transition-colors border border-slate-700"
          >
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M12 2C6.477 2 2 6.484 2 12.017c0 4.425 2.865 8.18 6.839 9.504.5.092.682-.217.682-.483 0-.237-.008-.868-.013-1.703-2.782.605-3.369-1.343-3.369-1.343-.454-1.158-1.11-1.466-1.11-1.466-.908-.62.069-.608.069-.608 1.003.07 1.53 1.032 1.53 1.032.892 1.53 2.341 1.088 2.91.832.092-.647.35-1.088.636-1.338-2.22-.253-4.555-1.113-4.555-4.951 0-1.093.39-1.988 1.029-2.688-.103-.253-.446-1.272.098-2.65 0 0 .84-.27 2.75 1.026A9.564 9.564 0 0112 6.844c.85.004 1.705.115 2.504.337 1.909-1.296 2.747-1.027 2.747-1.027.546 1.379.202 2.398.1 2.651.64.7 1.028 1.595 1.028 2.688 0 3.848-2.339 4.695-4.566 4.943.359.309.678.92.678 1.855 0 1.338-.012 2.419-.012 2.747 0 .268.18.58.688.482A10.019 10.019 0 0022 12.017C22 6.484 17.522 2 12 2z"></path></svg>
            <span>Ver Repositorio en GitHub</span>
          </a>

          <div class="bg-slate-950/80 rounded-lg p-2.5 border border-slate-800 text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400 flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="truncate">git clone {GITHUB_REPO}.git</span>
            <span class="text-slate-500 text-[10px]">Clone</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- API Key Notice Banner -->
    <div class="mt-12 bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6">
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
        <div class="p-3 bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/20 text-amber-400 rounded-xl shrink-0">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 7a2 2 0 012 2m4 0a6 6 0 01-7.743 5.743L11 17H9v2H7v2H4a1 1 0 01-1-1v-2.586a1 1 0 01.293-.707l5.964-5.964A6 6 0 1121 9z"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-white">¿Necesitas una API Key gratuita de Google Gemini?</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
            Agnes utiliza el modelo oficial de Google Gemini en su nivel gratuito. Solo necesitas iniciar sesión con tu cuenta de Google en Google AI Studio y generar tu clave en un clic.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <a 
        href="https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey" 
        target="_blank" 
        rel="noopener noreferrer" 
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-amber-300 font-bold text-xs border border-amber-500/30 shrink-0 transition-colors"
      >
        <span>Obtener API Key Gratis</span>
        <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14"></path></svg>
      </a>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
